# Every writable global of nsh's code, as nm(1) names it (a function's
# static as function.name), by file, and what it is. nsh-checks' globals
# check fails on one not listed, or listed and gone.
#
#	process	the process's own
#	scratch	written and read within one request
#	table	initialized, and written by nothing, or only once for the
#		process by what fills it in
#
# file		class	names
